#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:5
#: f13c896993b34665b27661e05510f832
msgid "Camera Controls and Parameters"
msgstr "相机控制与参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:7
#: f9ca9047f9f843799599d43f9aedfead
msgid ""
"This page provides an overview of general camera setup parameters and the "
"three different ways that cameras can be controlled.  The related page "
"detailing :ref:`gimbal controls can be found here <common-mount-targeting>`."
msgstr ""
"本页提供通用相机设置参数及三种相机控制方式的概述。相关的云台控制详情页面 :ref:`可在此处找到 <common-mount-targeting>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:10
#: d690434b25d14d4b81dd8bc2ba3feae7
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:12
#: 9ab2dcf85ee548fb8b37c3811dce71ec
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports up to two cameras. The following is for the first camera:"
msgstr "ArduPilot最多支持两台相机。以下为第一台相机的参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:14
#: 4b89af68ff2e49a2ac7c2ef7b9f7a229
msgid ":ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>`: Camera shutter (trigger) type"
msgstr ":ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>`：相机快门（触发器）类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:15
#: 0d02ecbd82d1474bac624d1180742f40
msgid ":ref:`CAM1_DURATION<CAM1_DURATION>`: Camera open shutter duration"
msgstr ":ref:`CAM1_DURATION<CAM1_DURATION>`：相机快门开启持续时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:16
#: bb76ce30d2b44e9c93e11fea2a3d8d5c
msgid ""
":ref:`CAM1_SERVO_ON<CAM1_SERVO_ON>`: Camera servo ON PWM value (Servo type "
"shutter only)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAM1_SERVO_ON<CAM1_SERVO_ON>`：相机舵机开启PWM值（仅适用于舵机类型快门）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:17
#: fb8957dab56e4554a1cdb6968b8884cf
msgid ""
":ref:`CAM1_SERVO_OFF<CAM1_SERVO_OFF>`: Camera servo OFF PWM value (Servo "
"type shutter only)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAM1_SERVO_OFF<CAM1_SERVO_OFF>`：相机舵机关闭PWM值（仅适用于舵机类型快门）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:18
#: 1d06dff8b07b4b7d9edc7080b199d418
msgid ""
":ref:`CAM1_TRIGG_DIST<CAM1_TRIGG_DIST>`: Camera trigger distance. If this "
"value is non-zero then the camera will trigger whenever the position changes"
" by this number of meters regardless of what mode the autopilot is in."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAM1_TRIGG_DIST<CAM1_TRIGG_DIST>`：相机触发距离。若此值非零，则无论飞控处于何种模式，只要位置变化达到此距离（米），相机就会触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:19
#: 7893df94b9624834ac310b14cd50a628
msgid ""
":ref:`CAM1_RELAY_ON<CAM1_RELAY_ON>`: Camera relay ON value. This sets "
"whether the relay goes high or low when it triggers. Note that you should "
"also set RELAY_DEFAULT appropriately for your camera(Relay type shutter "
"only)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAM1_RELAY_ON<CAM1_RELAY_ON>`：相机继电器开启值。设置触发时继电器高电平还是低电平。注意还应根据相机适当设置RELAY_DEFAULT（仅适用于继电器类型快门）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:20
#: 0da64c23d67b40949a815c3ab64db8cd
msgid ""
":ref:`CAM1_INTRVAL_MIN<CAM1_INTRVAL_MIN>`: Camera minimum time interval "
"between photos"
msgstr ":ref:`CAM1_INTRVAL_MIN<CAM1_INTRVAL_MIN>`：相机照片最小时间间隔。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:21
#: 7c182c7c8fea484f8168a416aefb849b
msgid ""
":ref:`CAM1_MNT_INST<CAM1_MNT_INST>`: If the camera is associated with a "
"MOUNTx instance, this indicates which MOUNTx instance. For example if CAM1 "
"is associated with MOUNT2, then this value will be 2. The default value of 0"
" for this parameter means that the Mount instance is the same as the Camera "
"instance, ie. CAM1 is in MOUNT1 and is the same as value \"1\" in this case."
" This allows Camera commands to be directed to the correct MOUNT instance."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAM1_MNT_INST<CAM1_MNT_INST>`：若相机与某个MOUNTx实例关联，此参数指示关联的MOUNTx实例编号。例如若CAM1与MOUNT2关联，则此值为2。默认值0表示挂载实例与相机实例相同，即CAM1在MOUNT1中，等同于值「1」。这允许相机命令定向到正确的MOUNT实例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:22
#: 3db4be472add4376be9f1b84975ac75c
msgid ""
":ref:`CAM1_OPTIONS<CAM1_OPTIONS>`: if bit 0 set and camera/mount has the "
"ability to start/stop video recording, then it will start on arm and stop on"
" disarm events."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAM1_OPTIONS<CAM1_OPTIONS>`：若第0位置位，且相机/云台具有开始/停止录像的能力，则解锁时开始录像，上锁时停止录像。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:25
#: d915e15662ae4f8cbbdf9d9f7c427085
msgid ""
"be sure to set the ``CAMx_INTRVAL_MIN`` to be greater than the fastest the "
"camera can take photos when using the camera trigger functions."
msgstr "使用相机触发功能时，请确保将 ``CAMx_INTRVAL_MIN`` 设置为大于相机拍照的最快间隔时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:27
#: 9092cbe370c94b158efa03fc0dc748b0
msgid ""
":ref:`CAM_MAX_ROLL<CAM_MAX_ROLL>`: Maximum photo roll angle. Postpone "
"shooting if roll is greater than limit. (0=Disable, will shoot regardless of"
" roll)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAM_MAX_ROLL<CAM_MAX_ROLL>`：最大拍照横滚角。若横滚角超过限制则推迟拍照。（0=禁用，无论横滚角多大都拍照）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:28
#: 8a41ee8d865041e09b6dbe9fc32fa630
msgid ""
":ref:`CAM_AUTO_ONLY<CAM_AUTO_ONLY>`: Distance-triggering in AUTO mode only."
msgstr ":ref:`CAM_AUTO_ONLY<CAM_AUTO_ONLY>`：仅在 Auto 模式下启用距离触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:31
#: 50fb8a96b7584e0fad05fb29de3b53fb
msgid "Control with an RC transmitter"
msgstr "通过遥控器控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:33
#: c2d082159f2b42728a87d1d0d9c9541e
msgid ""
"RC :ref:`auxiliary functions <common-auxiliary-functions>` allow the pilot "
"to control the camera features using an RC transmitter switch."
msgstr "RC :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>` 允许飞手使用遥控器拨杆控制相机功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:35
#: 290175c263a040c7867bcf3b29679ab0
msgid ""
"set :ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 9 (\"Camera Trigger\") to take a "
"picture"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RC6_OPTION <RC6_OPTION>` = 9（「Camera Trigger」）以拍照"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:36
#: b1a94472ce0f42d089a52b766cbc5a43
msgid ""
"set :ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 166 (\"Camera Record Video\") to "
"start/stop recording video"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`RC7_OPTION <RC7_OPTION>` = 166（「Camera Record Video」）以开始/停止录像"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:37
#: 3d6858e865f244d5ad0fd72069e9d83f
msgid ""
"set :ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 167 (\"Camera Zoom\") to zoom in or out"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RC8_OPTION <RC8_OPTION>` = 167（「Camera Zoom」）以放大或缩小"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:38
#: 2cd4c690f79140c8adcedc79d5f1c706
msgid ""
"set :ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 168 (\"Manual Focus\") to focus in or "
"out"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RC9_OPTION <RC9_OPTION>` = 168（「Manual Focus」）以手动对焦（拉近或拉远）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:39
#: 2d51fde127fa449f8da59530730116ef
msgid "set :ref:`RC10_OPTION <RC10_OPTION>` = 169 (\"Auto Focus\") to auto focus"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RC10_OPTION <RC10_OPTION>` = 169（「Auto Focus」）以自动对焦"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:42
#: 9ae004384f5d4a64a6798b189ac267c4
msgid "Control from a Ground Station"
msgstr "通过地面站控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:44
#: 306012e327c14dd28795456a6243cb1d
msgid ""
"Ground stations can send MAVLink commands to control the camera.  While each"
" GCS's interface is different below are the controls provided by Mission "
"Planner."
msgstr "地面站可通过 MAVLink 命令控制相机。各 GCS 界面不同，以下为 Mission Planner 提供的控制方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:46
#: 9d798cd0505c45988edaedb5231b0099
msgid ""
"Take a picture using the right-mouse-click menu, select \"Trigger Camera "
"NOW\""
msgstr "通过鼠标右键菜单拍照，选择「Trigger Camera NOW」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:51
#: c306527b3d0e432aad100dd886d2dffd
msgid ""
"Use any of the auxiliary function controls listed above from the Data, Aux "
"Functions tab."
msgstr "在 Data 页的 Aux Functions 标签页中使用上述任意辅助功能控件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:57
#: a92f388216d3444e84b5ecc776cfbd9d
msgid ""
"Note that these buttons are \"edge triggered\" which means that to trigger a"
" function multiple times you may need to push the \"Low\" or \"Mid\" button "
"betrween pushes of \"High\"."
msgstr "请注意，这些按钮为「边沿触发」，即多次触发同一功能时，可能需要在每次按「High」之间先按一次「Low」或「Mid」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:60
#: 4a44910fc5294e8b9c53ee8a262f3aeb
msgid "Control during Auto mode missions"
msgstr "在 Auto 模式任务期间控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-controls.rst:62
